                <mxCell id="31" value="Redemptions (/redemptions)&#xa;  - POST /: Request reward&#xa;  - GET /: Get requests&#xa;  - Admin approval flow&#xa;&#xa;Services (/services)&#xa;  - POST /: Create package&#xa;  - GET /: Browse packages&#xa;  - GET /my-services: Manage&#xa;&#xa;Admin (/admin)&#xa;  - GET /users: List all users&#xa;  - DELETE /users/:id: Remove&#xa;  - PATCH /users/:id/role: Update&#xa;  - GET /workspaces: Monitor&#xa;  - GET /logs: Audit trail&#xa;  - POST /tokens: Alter balance" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
